id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
19846::$$$message_0159_0000_0000$$$::I'm happy Illya's thinking of me, but I should go back to the city.[lr]::
19847::$$$message_0159_0000_0001$$$::The Holy Grail War is back.[lr]::
19848::$$$message_0159_0000_0002$$$::I didn't tell anyone I was going to the castle. The others must be worried.::
19849::$$$message_0159_0001_0000$$$::"No, I'm going home today, Illya. Let's have a sleepover when I come back to play next time."[lr]::
19850::$$$message_0159_0001_0001$$$::"Aww. It's such a long way back, though.[lr]::
19851::$$$message_0159_0001_0002$$$::You're still thinking about Sakura and the others even at a time like this."::
19852::$$$message_0159_0002_0000$$$::"Don't be unreasonable, Mistress.[lr]::
19853::$$$message_0159_0002_0001$$$::Go, Leysritt. Master Emiya is departing. Escort him to the forest."[lr]::
19854::$$$message_0159_0002_0002$$$::"...Okay. Too bad. Shirou's leaving."[lr]::
19855::$$$message_0159_0002_0003$$$::That settles that.[lr]::
19856::$$$message_0159_0002_0004$$$::It's a bummer, but we'll say goodbye for today.[wm canskip=0][clfg textoff=0 pos=all rule=シャッター左から time=400]::
19857::$$$message_0159_0003_0000$$$::"See you later, Illya! I'll come hang out another time!"[lr]::
19858::$$$message_0159_0003_0001$$$::I wave and say farewell.[lr]::
19859::$$$message_0159_0003_0002$$$::"Oh, Shirou... Okay. I'll have you spend the night next time. It's a promise, Shirou!"[lr]::
19860::$$$message_0159_0003_0003$$$::"I am impressed by your decorum, Master Emiya."::
19861::$$$message_0159_0004_0000$$$::Leys walks me out of the lobby.[lr]::
19862::$$$message_0159_0004_0001$$$::It's going to be nighttime by the time I'm back in the city.[lr]::
19863::$$$message_0159_0004_0002$$$::Now...how should I spend the last night?::
919856::$$$message_9159_0002_0004$$$::It's a bummer, but we'll say goodbye for today.[r]�y>